  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help us to support flood affected Orphans</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Several times in recent years, Pakistan has suffered from cataclysmic disasters. The earthquake that struck Kashmir in October 2005 killed over 70,000 people and made 3 million homeless. The recent floods of 2022 affected 33 million in Pakistan including thousands of Orphans. This project will therefore provide support to unprivileged orphans who faced the atrocities mentioned above. Currently, AKFP Orphan Support Program supports more than 20,000 orphans.</narrative>
  </description>
